      <title>网友“手搓”Apple Music 鸿蒙版应用：适配沉浸光感特性，上架时间待定</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260906/%E7%BD%91%E5%8F%8B%E6%89%8B%E6%90%93Apple-Music-%E9%B8%BF%E8%92%99%E7%89%88%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E9%80%82%E9%85%8D%E6%B2%89%E6%B5%B8%E5%85%89%E6%84%9F%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%8A%E6%9E%B6%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%BE%85%E5%AE%9A/</link>
